  ('30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', 'CMP-2026-00101', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001', 'f0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000015', 'Shift A', 'Hydraulic', 'critical', 'converted_to_wo', NOW() - INTERVAL '1 days 4 hours', NOW() - INTERVAL '1 days 3 hours 45 minutes', 4842.00, 39.50, 53.00, 'Main hydraulic relief valve chattering under full excavation pressure', 'During operational shift inspection by Tushar H. Shingade (Senior HMC Machine Operator), anomaly detected on asset PUN-HMC-001 (Mazak Horizontal Machining Center HCN-6800 NEO #1): Main hydraulic relief valve chattering under full excavation pressure. Machine stopped immediately as per JCB safety guidelines.', 'Acknowledged by Plant Maintenance Supervisor. Priority set to critical. Technician assignment dispatched.'),
