  ('30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', 'CMP-2026-00103', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003', 'f0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000017', 'Shift A', 'Electrical', 'medium', 'converted_to_wo', NOW() - INTERVAL '13 days 4 hours', NOW() - INTERVAL '13 days 3 hours 45 minutes', 3089.50, 41.50, 55.00, 'Fanuc robot joint 3 servo collision emergency stop during boom welding', 'During operational shift inspection by Vijay K. Lokhande (Schuler 1000T Press Operator), anomaly detected on asset PUN-VMC-001 (Makino Vertical Machining Center V99 Heavy Milling): Fanuc robot joint 3 servo collision emergency stop during boom welding. Machine stopped immediately as per JCB safety guidelines.', 'Acknowledged by Plant Maintenance Supervisor. Priority set to medium. Technician assignment dispatched.'),
  ('30000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004', 'CMP-2026-00104', '20000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004', 'f0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000018', 'Shift A', 'Pneumatics', 'low', 'converted_to_wo', NOW() - INTERVAL '12 days 4 hours', NOW() - INTERVAL '12 days 3 hours 45 minutes', 6308.75, 42.50, 56.00, 'Schuler 1000T hydraulic press ram seal oil leak pooling on floor', 'During operational shift inspection by Pradeep B. Wagh (Trumpf Laser Cutting Operator), anomaly detected on asset PUN-VMC-002 (Doosan DNM 6700 High Productivity VMC): Schuler 1000T hydraulic press ram seal oil leak pooling on floor. Machine stopped immediately as per JCB safety guidelines.', 'Acknowledged by Plant Maintenance Supervisor. Priority set to low. Technician assignment dispatched.'),
